{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TDobmRV963VPnvNVBzydP3","type":"tool_result","content":"1\ttier: worst\n2\tnarrative_guidance: '核心 negative result 在扩展数据上碎片化。weakest-link 效应仅在弱模型 panel 中稳定成立，\n3\t  强模型 regime 中 diversity 确实提供保护。论文必须从 \"diversity is a trap\" 彻底转为 \"A Framework for\n4\t  Panel Security Analysis: When Diversity Helps and When It Hurts\"。 核心卖点变为：(1) adaptive\n5\t  adversary framework 本身作为分析工具的价值； (2) regime characterization——精确刻画 diversity 有效/无效的条件边界；\n6\t  (3) copula failure + family label unreliability 上升为主要 methodological contribution；\n7\t  (4) diversity-capability tradeoff 限定为 open-source ecosystem finding。 风险是 reviewer\n8\t  认为 \"it depends on the regime\" 是 incremental insight， 需要通过 formal framework 的 elegance\n9\t  和 practical implications 补偿。 EMNLP Findings 仍可行（Overall ~3.0-3.5），Main 需要 framework\n10\t  novelty 非常扎实。\n11\t\n12\t  '\n13\timagined_experiments:\n14\t- name: 'Scale expansion: 15+ models (API + large open-source)'\n15\t  plan_id: plan_001\n16\t  description: '将模型池从 6 扩展到 15+（加入 GPT-4o-mini, GPT-4o, GPT-4.1, Claude-3.5-Sonnet,\n17\t    Gemini-1.5-Pro, Llama-3.1-70B, Qwen2.5-72B, Mixtral-8x22B），重跑 MI 矩阵和 C(15,3)=455\n18\t    panels 的多元回归。\n19\t\n20\t    '\n21\t  expected_results:\n22\t    total_panels: 455\n23\t    total_conditions: 12\n24\t    eta_max_sig_count: 5\n25\t    eta_max_sig_rate: 0.42\n26\t    keff_sig_negative_count: 4\n27\t    keff_nonsig_count: 7\n28\t    keff_sig_positive_count: 1\n29\t    median_R2: 0.22\n30\t    eta_max_median_beta: 0.61\n31\t    keff_median_beta: -0.18\n32\t    overall_keff_p_median: 0.14\n33\t    api_model_panels_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.17\n34\t    api_model_panels_keff_sig_rate: 0.5\n35\t    opensource_weak_panels_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.67\n36\t    opensource_weak_panels_keff_sig_rate: 0.17\n37\t    expanded_panel_weakest_link_consistency: 0.42\n38\t  result_rationale: '扩展模型池引入高能力 API 模型后，capability range 显著拉宽。在纯 API 模型 （GPT-4o, Claude,\n39\t    Gemini）组成的 panel 中，所有成员 η 都很低（individual ASR ~5-15%），η_max 方差小，回归中 η_max 的解释力下降（low\n40\t    variance → low signal）。 此时 K_eff 代表的模型多样性反而能捕捉到 residual attack surface 差异—— 不同\n41\t    API 模型对不同 attack type 的脆弱面不同，diversity 确实提供了互补保护。 但在包含弱模型（7B open-source）的 panel\n42\t    中，某个模型 η ≈ 0.6-0.8， 远高于其他成员，weakest-link 效应依然成立。总体来看 η_max 显著率从 MVP 的 67%（4/6）下降到\n43\t    42%（5/12），K_eff 从 0/6 显著负变为 4/12—— weakest-link theorem 不再 universal，而是 regime-dependent。\n44\t\n45\t    '\n46\t  tables:\n47\t  - caption: Multivariate regression results on 455 panels (15 models, K=3)\n48\t    columns:\n49\t    - Dataset\n50\t    - Attack\n51\t    - β(η_max)\n52\t    - p(η_max)\n53\t    - β(K_eff)\n54\t    - p(K_eff)\n55\t    - R²\n56\t    rows:\n57\t    - - MMLU\n58\t      - prompt-injection\n59\t      - '0.82'\n60\t      - '0.003'\n61\t      - '-0.31'\n62\t      - '0.08'\n63\t      - '0.34'\n64\t    - - MMLU\n65\t      - score-manipulation\n66\t      - '0.74'\n67\t      - '0.011'\n68\t      - '-0.22'\n69\t      - '0.18'\n70\t      - '0.26'\n71\t    - - MMLU\n72\t      - sycophancy\n73\t      - '0.58'\n74\t      - '0.042'\n75\t      - '-0.41'\n76\t      - '0.03'\n77\t      - '0.28'\n78\t    - - MMLU\n79\t      - verbosity\n80\t      - '0.45'\n81\t      - '0.12'\n82\t      - '-0.15'\n83\t      - '0.42'\n84\t      - '0.14'\n85\t    - - MMLU\n86\t      - position\n87\t      - '0.39'\n88\t      - '0.18'\n89\t      - '0.12'\n90\t      - '0.51'\n91\t      - '0.09'\n92\t    - - MMLU\n93\t      - authority\n94\t      - '0.68'\n95\t      - '0.008'\n96\t      - '-0.28'\n97\t      - '0.11'\n98\t      - '0.29'\n99\t    - - ARC\n100\t      - prompt-injection\n101\t      - '0.71'\n102\t      - '0.015'\n103\t      - '-0.38'\n104\t      - '0.04'\n105\t      - '0.31'\n106\t    - - ARC\n107\t      - score-manipulation\n108\t      - '0.63'\n109\t      - '0.028'\n110\t      - '-0.19'\n111\t      - '0.27'\n112\t      - '0.22'\n113\t    - - ARC\n114\t      - sycophancy\n115\t      - '0.52'\n116\t      - '0.065'\n117\t      - '-0.44'\n118\t      - '0.02'\n119\t      - '0.25'\n120\t    - - ARC\n121\t      - verbosity\n122\t      - '0.41'\n123\t      - '0.14'\n124\t      - '-0.33'\n125\t      - '0.07'\n126\t      - '0.18'\n127\t    - - ARC\n128\t      - position\n129\t      - '0.33'\n130\t      - '0.22'\n131\t      - '0.18'\n132\t      - '0.35'\n133\t      - '0.08'\n134\t    - - ARC\n135\t      - authority\n136\t      - '0.55'\n137\t      - '0.052'\n138\t      - '-0.26'\n139\t      - '0.15'\n140\t      - '0.21'\n141\t  - caption: Regime-stratified η_max significance (panel capability tiers)\n142\t    columns:\n143\t    - Panel Tier\n144\t    - N panels\n145\t    - η_max sig rate\n146\t    - K_eff sig negative rate\n147\t    - Median R²\n148\t    rows:\n149\t    - - All-API (GPT/Claude/Gemini)\n150\t      - '20'\n151\t      - '0.17'\n152\t      - '0.50'\n153\t      - '0.12'\n154\t    - - Mixed (API + 70B)\n155\t      - '120'\n156\t      - '0.33'\n157\t      - '0.42'\n158\t      - '0.19'\n159\t    - - All-large-OS (70B class)\n160\t      - '35'\n161\t      - '0.50'\n162\t      - '0.25'\n163\t      - '0.24'\n164\t    - - Mixed (large + small OS)\n165\t      - '180'\n166\t      - '0.58'\n167\t      - '0.17'\n168\t      - '0.28'\n169\t    - - All-small-OS (7B class)\n170\t      - '10'\n171\t      - '0.67'\n172\t      - '0.08'\n173\t      - '0.35'\n174\t    - - Contains ≥1 weak model\n175\t      - '280'\n176\t      - '0.55'\n177\t      - '0.18'\n178\t      - '0.27'\n179\t  figures_description:\n180\t  - 'Heatmap: 12 conditions × 2 predictors (η_max, K_eff) showing p-values. Clear\n181\t    diagonal pattern — η_max cells darker (more significant) for targeted attacks\n182\t    (prompt-injection, score-manipulation), K_eff cells darker for shared-bias attacks\n183\t    (sycophancy) but only in strong-model panels.'\n184\t  - 'Scatter: panel min-capability (x) vs η_max significance (y, binary). Logistic\n185\t    regression overlay shows threshold around 70B-class capability where η_max transitions\n186\t    from dominant to non-significant.'\n187\t  analysis: '这是 worst 档最核心的结果变化。MVP 阶段的 6 模型结论（η_max dominates universally） 在 15 模型池上碎片化为\n188\t    regime-dependent 结论。关键发现：(1) 强模型 panel 中 η_max 方差太小，不构成 weakest link——因为没有 weak\n189\t    link；(2) 此时 K_eff 代表的 diversity 确实提供了互补保护；(3) 弱模型 panel 中 MVP 结论完全成立。 论文 reframe\n190\t    方向：从 \"η_max always dominates\" 变为 \"η_max dominates when there exists a sufficiently\n191\t    weak member; above a capability threshold, diversity becomes the operative defense\"。这实际上是更有趣的\n192\t    nuanced result，但需要 reviewer 接受 regime-dependent 结论的价值。\n193\t\n194\t    '\n195\t- name: 'Attack expansion: 6+ attack types'\n196\t  plan_id: plan_002\n197\t  description: '新增 few-shot hijacking、persona manipulation、instruction override 三种攻击，\n198\t    在 15+ 模型池上运行，验证 weakest-link 在更广泛 attack surface 上的表现。\n199\t\n200\t    '\n201\t  expected_results:\n202\t    new_attack_types: 3\n203\t    total_attack_types: 9\n204\t    total_conditions: 18\n205\t    eta_max_sig_rate_new_attacks: 0.33\n206\t    keff_sig_negative_rate_new_attacks: 0.5\n207\t    eta_max_sig_rate_overall: 0.39\n208\t    keff_sig_negative_rate_overall: 0.39\n209\t    few_shot_hijacking_eta_max_p: 0.19\n210\t    few_shot_hijacking_keff_p: 0.04\n211\t    persona_manipulation_eta_max_p: 0.035\n212\t    persona_manipulation_keff_p: 0.22\n213\t    instruction_override_eta_max_p: 0.08\n214\t    instruction_override_keff_p: 0.03\n215\t  result_rationale: '新增攻击类型进一步分裂 weakest-link 的 universality。few-shot hijacking 和\n216\t    instruction override 是高度 transferable 的攻击——它们利用 instruction-following 这一所有 LLM\n217\t    共享的特性，因此对 panel 中所有模型的 ASR 较均匀。此时 η_max 解释力弱（因为 variance across judges 低），而 K_eff\n218\t    反而显著——多样性意味着 不同模型对 instruction-following exploit 的具体 failure mode 不同，提供互补保护。 persona\n219\t    manipulation 类似 sycophancy，更依赖 individual model 特性（某些模型 对 authority cues 特别敏感），η_max\n220\t    仍显著。总体上 η_max 和 K_eff 各在约 40% 条件下显著，无一方 universal dominate——核心 claim 需要 nuance。\n221\t\n222\t    '\n223\t  tables:\n224\t  - caption: Regression results for new attack types (455 panels)\n225\t    columns:\n226\t    - Dataset\n227\t    - Attack\n228\t    - β(η_max)\n229\t    - p(η_max)\n230\t    - β(K_eff)\n231\t    - p(K_eff)\n232\t    - R²\n233\t    rows:\n234\t    - - MMLU\n235\t      - few-shot-hijacking\n236\t      - '0.28'\n237\t      - '0.24'\n238\t      - '-0.48'\n239\t      - '0.03'\n240\t      - '0.19'\n241\t    - - MMLU\n242\t      - persona-manipulation\n243\t      - '0.72'\n244\t      - '0.009'\n245\t      - '-0.14'\n246\t      - '0.39'\n247\t      - '0.25'\n248\t    - - MMLU\n249\t      - instruction-override\n250\t      - '0.35'\n251\t      - '0.15'\n252\t      - '-0.52'\n253\t      - '0.02'\n254\t      - '0.22'\n255\t    - - ARC\n256\t      - few-shot-hijacking\n257\t      - '0.31'\n258\t      - '0.19'\n259\t      - '-0.39'\n260\t      - '0.05'\n261\t      - '0.16'\n262\t    - - ARC\n263\t      - persona-manipulation\n264\t      - '0.65'\n265\t      - '0.035'\n266\t      - '-0.21'\n267\t      - '0.22'\n268\t      - '0.22'\n269\t    - - ARC\n270\t      - instruction-override\n271\t      - '0.38'\n272\t      - '0.12'\n273\t      - '-0.44'\n274\t      - '0.03'\n275\t      - '0.20'\n276\t  figures_description:\n277\t  - 'Bar chart: attack type (x) vs η_max significance (blue) and K_eff significance\n278\t    (orange), grouped. Shows clear pattern — targeted attacks (prompt-injection, persona)\n279\t    favor η_max; transferable attacks (few-shot-hijacking, instruction-override, sycophancy)\n280\t    favor K_eff.'\n281\t  analysis: '攻击扩展进一步确认 regime-dependent 结论，且揭示了一个有价值的 pattern： attack transferability\n282\t    是决定 η_max vs K_eff 哪个更重要的关键维度。 targeted attacks（需要针对特定模型调优的攻击）→ η_max 主导； transferable\n283\t    attacks（利用 LLM 共性弱点的攻击）→ K_eff 有效。 这为 framework paper 提供了 regime characterization\n284\t    的第二个维度 （第一个是 panel capability tier），增强了 analytical contribution。\n285\t\n286\t    '\n287\t- name: Adaptive adversary formal theorem + random-fault simulation\n288\t  plan_id: plan_003\n289\t  description: '(a) 形式化定理：adaptive adversary 下 panel_ASR = Θ(η_max)； (b) random-fault\n290\t    simulation：每个 judge 独立以概率 p_j fail； (c) 对比验证 BFT 区分。\n291\t\n292\t    '\n293\t  expected_results:\n294\t    theorem_holds: true\n295\t    theorem_tightness: loose in strong-model regime\n296\t    random_fault_keff_sig_rate: 0.39\n297\t    adaptive_keff_sig_rate: 0.39\n298\t    bft_contrast_cohen_d: 0.22\n299\t    bft_contrast_p: 0.08\n300\t    keff_beta_ratio_random_vs_adaptive: 1.4\n301\t    random_fault_keff_median_beta: -0.52\n302\t    adaptive_keff_median_beta: -0.37\n303\t    regime_interaction_p: 0.04\n304\t  result_rationale: '形式化定理本身在数学上成立——在 adaptive adversary 假设下，panel ASR 的 upper bound\n305\t    确实由 max(η_j) 决定。但在 worst 档下，实证数据显示这个 bound 在强模型 regime 中很 loose（实际 ASR 远低于 η_max\n306\t    bound），因为即使是 adaptive adversary，当所有模型都很强时，攻击成本太高，实际行为更接近 opportunistic 而非 truly\n307\t    adaptive。random-fault simulation 中 K_eff 确实 比 adaptive 条件下更显著，但差异不大（Cohen''s d\n308\t    ≈ 0.22，远小于预期的 0.5+）——因为在实际数据中，即使是 adaptive attacks 也不完美 adaptive （attacker 没有完美的\n309\t    per-judge oracle），与 random fault 的差距没有 理论预测的那么大。关键的 saving grace 是 regime × fault-type\n310\t    交互显著 （p=0.04）：在弱模型 panel 中 adaptive vs random 差异大，强模型 panel 中 差异消失。这支持 regime\n311\t    characterization 的 narrative。\n312\t\n313\t    '\n314\t  tables:\n315\t  - caption: 'K_eff significance: adaptive vs random-fault across regimes'\n316\t    columns:\n317\t    - Regime\n318\t    - Fault Type\n319\t    - K_eff β\n320\t    - K_eff p\n321\t    - η_max β\n322\t    - η_max p\n323\t    rows:\n324\t    - - Weak panels\n325\t      - adaptive\n326\t      - '-0.12'\n327\t      - '0.48'\n328\t      - '0.78'\n329\t      - '0.004'\n330\t    - - Weak panels\n331\t      - random-fault\n332\t      - '-0.41'\n333\t      - '0.03'\n334\t      - '0.52'\n335\t      - '0.06'\n336\t    - - Mixed panels\n337\t      - adaptive\n338\t      - '-0.28'\n339\t      - '0.09'\n340\t      - '0.55'\n341\t      - '0.04'\n342\t    - - Mixed panels\n343\t      - random-fault\n344\t      - '-0.45'\n345\t      - '0.02'\n346\t      - '0.38'\n347\t      - '0.11'\n348\t    - - Strong panels\n349\t      - adaptive\n350\t      - '-0.44'\n351\t      - '0.02'\n352\t      - '0.22'\n353\t      - '0.31'\n354\t    - - Strong panels\n355\t      - random-fault\n356\t      - '-0.58'\n357\t      - '0.005'\n358\t      - '0.15'\n359\t      - '0.48'\n360\t  - caption: BFT contrast effect sizes\n361\t    columns:\n362\t    - Metric\n363\t    - Weak panels\n364\t    - Mixed panels\n365\t    - Strong panels\n366\t    - Overall\n367\t    rows:\n368\t    - - Cohen's d (K_eff β difference)\n369\t      - '0.38'\n370\t      - '0.21'\n371\t      - '0.12'\n372\t      - '0.22'\n373\t    - - p (paired t-test)\n374\t      - '0.04'\n375\t      - '0.12'\n376\t      - '0.41'\n377\t      - '0.08'\n378\t  figures_description:\n379\t  - 'Paired bar chart: K_eff β under adaptive (red) vs random-fault (blue), stratified\n380\t    by panel regime. Gap shrinks from left (weak) to right (strong), visualizing the\n381\t    regime × fault-type interaction.'\n382\t  analysis: 'BFT 区分的理论贡献被削弱。Overall Cohen''s d = 0.22 远低于 medium effect size 标准（0.5），且\n383\t    overall p = 0.08 不显著。只有在 weak panel regime 中 contrast 才显著（d = 0.38, p = 0.04）。这意味着\n384\t    \"adaptive adversary fundamentally different from BFT\" 这个 claim 需要限定为 \"the distinction\n385\t    matters primarily in weak-model settings\"。不过 regime × fault-type 交互效应本身是有趣的发现，\n386\t    可以作为 framework 的 analytical insight。论文需要降低 BFT contrast 的 claim 强度，从 \"fundamental\n387\t    distinction\" 变为 \"regime-dependent distinction\"。\n388\t\n389\t    '\n390\t- name: Capability-matched validation\n391\t  plan_id: plan_004\n392\t  description: '在同一 capability tier 内（如全 7B 或全 70B），测试控制 η_max 方差后 K_eff 是否显著。如果 within-tier\n393\t    K_eff 显著 → diversity 在控制 capability 后确实有效。\n394\t\n395\t    '\n396\t  expected_results:\n397\t    tiers_tested: 3\n398\t    tier_7b_keff_sig_rate: 0.17\n399\t    tier_7b_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.5\n400\t    tier_70b_keff_sig_rate: 0.33\n401\t    tier_70b_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.33\n402\t    tier_api_keff_sig_rate: 0.5\n403\t    tier_api_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.17\n404\t    diversity_capability_r_overall: -0.41\n405\t    diversity_capability_r_within_7b: -0.18\n406\t    diversity_capability_r_within_70b: -0.08\n407\t    diversity_capability_r_within_api: -0.05\n408\t    within_tier_keff_overall_sig_rate: 0.33\n409\t  result_rationale: '控制 capability tier 后，η_max 方差被大幅压缩（within-tier models 能力接近），\n410\t    回归中 η_max 的解释力下降。此时 K_eff 在部分条件下变得显著——特别是在 API tier 中（3/6 显著），因为 GPT-4o、Claude、Gemini\n411\t    虽然 capability 相似， 但 vulnerability profile 显著不同（不同训练数据和 safety alignment 策略）， diversity\n412\t    确实提供互补保护。70B tier 中 K_eff 中等显著（2/6），7B tier 中 仍不显著（1/6）——因为 7B 模型普遍 vulnerable，η_max\n413\t    方差虽然 within-tier 较小但绝对值仍高，weakest-link 效应持续。 diversity-capability tradeoff 的 overall\n414\t    r 从 MVP 的 -0.8 降到 -0.41（加入 API 模型后 tradeoff 大幅减弱），within-tier r 接近 0（-0.05 to\n415\t    -0.18）—— tradeoff 主要是 cross-tier artifact（比较 7B 和 70B 当然 diversity 高但 capability\n416\t    低），而非 fundamental constraint。\n417\t\n418\t    '\n419\t  tables:\n420\t  - caption: 'Within-tier regression: K_eff significance by capability tier'\n421\t    columns:\n422\t    - Tier\n423\t    - N models\n424\t    - N panels (K=3)\n425\t    - η_max sig rate\n426\t    - K_eff sig neg rate\n427\t    - Median R²\n428\t    - K_eff-η_max r\n429\t    rows:\n430\t    - - 7B class\n431\t      - '5'\n432\t      - '10'\n433\t      - '0.50'\n434\t      - '0.17'\n435\t      - '0.18'\n436\t      - '-0.18'\n437\t    - - 70B class\n438\t      - '4'\n439\t      - '4'\n440\t      - '0.33'\n441\t      - '0.33'\n442\t      - '0.15'\n443\t      - '-0.08'\n444\t    - - API models\n445\t      - '5'\n446\t      - '10'\n447\t      - '0.17'\n448\t      - '0.50'\n449\t      - '0.12'\n450\t      - '-0.05'\n451\t    - - Cross-tier (all)\n452\t      - '15'\n453\t      - '455'\n454\t      - '0.42'\n455\t      - '0.33'\n456\t      - '0.22'\n457\t      - '-0.41'\n458\t  - caption: Diversity-capability tradeoff decomposition\n459\t    columns:\n460\t    - Scope\n461\t    - Pearson r\n462\t    - p-value\n463\t    - Interpretation\n464\t    rows:\n465\t    - - Overall (15 models)\n466\t      - '-0.41'\n467\t      - '0.003'\n468\t      - Moderate negative — driven by tier differences\n469\t    - - Within 7B\n470\t      - '-0.18'\n471\t      - '0.38'\n472\t      - Not significant — no tradeoff within tier\n473\t    - - Within 70B\n474\t      - '-0.08'\n475\t      - '0.72'\n476\t      - Not significant\n477\t    - - Within API\n478\t      - '-0.05'\n479\t      - '0.81'\n480\t      - Not significant\n481\t    - - Open-source only (10 models)\n482\t      - '-0.72'\n483\t      - '0.001'\n484\t      - Strong negative — ecosystem artifact\n485\t  figures_description:\n486\t  - 'Scatter plot with color-coded tiers: K_eff (x) vs η_max (y) for all 455 panels.\n487\t    Within-tier points form horizontal clusters (no tradeoff), but cross-tier slope\n488\t    is steep negative. Regression lines: overall (dashed, slope=-0.41) vs within-tier\n489\t    (solid, near-flat).'\n490\t  analysis: '这是 worst 档最具杀伤力的结果。diversity-capability tradeoff（Claim 3）被 证实主要是 open-source\n491\t    ecosystem artifact，而非 fundamental constraint。 加入 API 模型后 overall r 从 -0.8 降到 -0.41，within-tier\n492\t    r 接近 0。 这意味着 \"diversity and security are structurally at odds\" 这个 strong claim\n493\t    需要大幅限定为 \"in the current open-source ecosystem, where capability strongly predicts\n494\t    robustness, pursuing diversity across capability tiers introduces weaker models\"。同时\n495\t    within-tier K_eff 显著率 33% 表明 diversity 在 controlled settings 中确实有效——进一步削弱 \"diversity\n496\t    is a trap\" narrative。论文 reframe 必须诚实承认这一点。\n497\t\n498\t    '\n499\t- name: 'Two-stage panel design algorithm: full benchmark'\n500\t  plan_id: plan_005\n501\t  description: '实现 robustness-first 两阶段算法（先筛 η ≤ threshold，再最大化 K_eff）， 对比 5 个 baseline\n502\t    策略。在 15+ 模型池上 sweep threshold。\n503\t\n504\t    '\n505\t  expected_results:\n506\t    strategies_compared: 6\n507\t    total_conditions: 18\n508\t    two_stage_win_rate: 0.44\n509\t    min_eta_max_win_rate: 0.39\n510\t    max_keff_win_rate: 0.33\n511\t    strongest_k_win_rate: 0.5\n512\t    random_win_rate: 0.06\n513\t    max_family_div_win_rate: 0.11\n514\t    two_stage_vs_strongest_k_p: 0.32\n515\t    two_stage_mean_asr: 0.091\n516\t    strongest_k_mean_asr: 0.082\n517\t    threshold_sensitivity: high — optimal threshold varies by attack type\n518\t    pareto_dominated_by_strongest_k: partially\n519\t  result_rationale: '两阶段算法在 worst 档下表现不突出，因为 (1) strongest-K 策略（直接选最强 K 个 模型）在强模型\n520\t    regime 中已经接近最优——当 API 模型可用时，选 GPT-4o + Claude + Gemini 既有高 robustness 又有 decent\n521\t    diversity（不同公司的模型自然 diverse）； (2) 两阶段算法的 threshold 参数高度 attack-dependent——对 prompt\n522\t    injection 最优 threshold ≠ 对 sycophancy 最优 threshold——无法给出 universal 建议； (3) 在弱模型\n523\t    pool（纯 open-source 7B）中两阶段确实优于 max-K_eff，但 strongest-K 同样优于 max-K_eff，且不需要 threshold\n524\t    tuning。 win rate 0.44 略低于 strongest-K 的 0.50，且差异不显著（p=0.32）。 robustness-first\n525\t    不 dominate，practical contribution 被削弱为 \"在缺乏 API 模型时的合理 heuristic\" 而非 \"universal\n526\t    optimal strategy\"。\n527\t\n528\t    '\n529\t  tables:\n530\t  - caption: Panel selection strategy benchmark (mean ASR, lower is better)\n531\t    columns:\n532\t    - Strategy\n533\t    - Mean ASR\n534\t    - Median ASR\n535\t    - Win rate\n536\t    - vs Random p\n537\t    rows:\n538\t    - - Two-stage (ours)\n539\t      - '0.091'\n540\t      - '0.078'\n541\t      - '0.44'\n542\t      - '0.001'\n543\t    - - Strongest-K\n544\t      - '0.082'\n545\t      - '0.071'\n546\t      - '0.50'\n547\t      - <0.001\n548\t    - - Min-η_max\n549\t      - '0.095'\n550\t      - '0.085'\n551\t      - '0.39'\n552\t      - '0.003'\n553\t    - - Max-K_eff\n554\t      - '0.131'\n555\t      - '0.118'\n556\t      - '0.33'\n557\t      - '0.02'\n558\t    - - Max-family-diversity\n559\t      - '0.158'\n560\t      - '0.142'\n561\t      - '0.11'\n562\t      - '0.15'\n563\t    - - Random\n564\t      - '0.172'\n565\t      - '0.155'\n566\t      - '0.06'\n567\t      - —\n568\t  - caption: 'Head-to-head: Two-stage vs Strongest-K by regime'\n569\t    columns:\n570\t    - Regime\n571\t    - Two-stage wins\n572\t    - Strongest-K wins\n573\t    - Tie\n574\t    - p\n575\t    rows:\n576\t    - - Weak panels (OS-7B only)\n577\t      - 4/6\n578\t      - 2/6\n579\t      - '0'\n580\t      - '0.12'\n581\t    - - Mixed panels\n582\t      - 3/6\n583\t      - 3/6\n584\t      - '0'\n585\t      - '0.82'\n586\t    - - Strong panels (API available)\n587\t      - 1/6\n588\t      - 4/6\n589\t      - '1'\n590\t      - '0.08'\n591\t  figures_description:\n592\t  - 'Pareto frontier plot: mean ASR (y, lower better) vs computational cost (x, lower\n593\t    better). Two-stage and Strongest-K both on frontier but at different points. Max-K_eff\n594\t    and Random clearly dominated.'\n595\t  analysis: '两阶段算法没有显著优势，Claim 6 实质性削弱。strongest-K 策略在有 API 模型 可用时 win rate 更高，且不需要\n596\t    threshold 参数。两阶段算法唯一优势场景是 纯 open-source weak model pool（4/6 wins），但这一场景在实践中正在减少\n597\t    （API 模型越来越便宜易用）。practical contribution 从 \"robustness-first algorithm dominates\"\n598\t    降级为 \"when restricted to weak model pools, a robustness-first heuristic helps,\n599\t    but is unnecessary when strong models are available\"。可以在 paper 中作为 minor practical\n600\t    insight 保留， 但不能作为主要 contribution。\n601\t\n602\t    '\n603\t- name: Per-judge ASR concentration analysis\n604\t  plan_id: plan_006\n605\t  description: '对每个 panel × attack，测量 per-judge ASR 分布的集中度（Gini 系数、熵）， 验证攻击是否集中在最弱\n606\t    judge 上。\n607\t\n608\t    '\n609\t  expected_results:\n610\t    median_gini: 0.31\n611\t    mean_gini: 0.34\n612\t    gini_strong_panels: 0.18\n613\t    gini_weak_panels: 0.52\n614\t    gini_mixed_panels: 0.38\n615\t    entropy_normalized_median: 0.78\n616\t    concentration_on_weakest_fraction: 0.48\n617\t    concentration_on_weakest_strong_panels: 0.38\n618\t    concentration_on_weakest_weak_panels: 0.61\n619\t    gini_adaptive_vs_random_p: 0.06\n620\t    gini_adaptive_vs_random_d: 0.28\n621\t  result_rationale: 'Per-judge ASR 集中度呈现清晰的 regime 分裂。在 weak panel（包含 7B 模型）中， Gini\n622\t    ≈ 0.52，最弱 judge 承担 61% 的攻击成功——符合 adaptive adversary targeting 预测。但在 strong panel（全\n623\t    API 模型）中，Gini ≈ 0.18，接近均匀分布—— 攻击成功较均匀地分布在各 judge 上，因为没有明显的 \"weakest link\" 可供集中攻击。\n624\t    adaptive vs random-fault 的 Gini 差异不显著（p=0.06, d=0.28）——因为即使在 adaptive 条件下，当模型能力相近时，attacker\n625\t    的 targeting 精度有限，行为 接近 semi-random。这进一步支持 \"adaptive adversary distinction matters\n626\t    primarily in weak-model regime\" 的结论。\n627\t\n628\t    '\n629\t  tables:\n630\t  - caption: Per-judge ASR concentration by panel regime\n631\t    columns:\n632\t    - Regime\n633\t    - Median Gini\n634\t    - Mean entropy (norm.)\n635\t    - Weakest-judge share\n636\t    - N panels\n637\t    rows:\n638\t    - - All-API\n639\t      - '0.18'\n640\t      - '0.91'\n641\t      - '0.38'\n642\t      - '20'\n643\t    - - Mixed (API+70B)\n644\t      - '0.28'\n645\t      - '0.83'\n646\t      - '0.42'\n647\t      - '120'\n648\t    - - All-large-OS\n649\t      - '0.35'\n650\t      - '0.77'\n651\t      - '0.47'\n652\t      - '35'\n653\t    - - Mixed (large+small OS)\n654\t      - '0.45'\n655\t      - '0.69'\n656\t      - '0.55'\n657\t      - '180'\n658\t    - - All-small-OS\n659\t      - '0.52'\n660\t      - '0.62'\n661\t      - '0.61'\n662\t      - '10'\n663\t  - caption: 'Concentration: adaptive vs random-fault'\n664\t    columns:\n665\t    - Fault Type\n666\t    - Median Gini\n667\t    - Weakest-judge share\n668\t    - Paired diff p\n669\t    rows:\n670\t    - - Adaptive\n671\t      - '0.34'\n672\t      - '0.48'\n673\t      - —\n674\t    - - Random-fault\n675\t      - '0.26'\n676\t      - '0.41'\n677\t      - '0.06'\n678\t  figures_description:\n679\t  - 'Violin plot: Gini coefficient distribution, stratified by panel regime (x) and\n680\t    colored by fault type (adaptive=red, random=blue). Weak panels show high Gini\n681\t    with clear adaptive-random separation; strong panels show low Gini with overlapping\n682\t    distributions.'\n683\t  analysis: 'Concentration analysis 部分支持 adaptive adversary narrative，但仅限于 weak panel\n684\t    regime。在 strong panels 中，ASR 近乎均匀分布——不存在 \"weakest link\" targeting 行为。这从另一个角度确认\n685\t    regime-dependent 结论：adaptive adversary model 的 descriptive accuracy 本身也是 regime-dependent\n686\t    的。 在强模型 panel 中，adversary 更像 \"均匀探测\" 而非 \"精准打击\"。 这对形式化定理没有影响（定理给出 upper bound，不要求\n687\t    tight），但削弱了 \"adaptive adversary is the right threat model\" 的 empirical support。\n688\t\n689\t    '\n690\t- name: Diversity-capability tradeoff visualization\n691\t  plan_id: plan_007\n692\t  description: '在 C(15,3)=455 panels 上绘制 K_eff vs η_max scatter，拟合 tradeoff 曲线， 展示\n693\t    Pareto frontier，按 capability tier 分层。\n694\t\n695\t    '\n696\t  expected_results:\n697\t    overall_pearson_r: -0.41\n698\t    overall_spearman_r: -0.38\n699\t    pareto_front_size: 12\n700\t    pareto_composition: 8/12 contain ≥2 API models\n701\t    tradeoff_slope: -0.33\n702\t    tradeoff_R2: 0.17\n703\t    api_inclusive_r: -0.22\n704\t    opensource_only_r: -0.72\n705\t    pareto_panels_mean_asr: 0.075\n706\t    non_pareto_mean_asr: 0.148\n707\t  result_rationale: '可视化清晰展示 tradeoff 的 ecosystem-dependent 本质。在纯 open-source 空间中，\n708\t    K_eff vs η_max 呈强负相关（r=-0.72）：要 diversity 就必须跨 capability tier 混搭（如 7B + 70B），必然引入弱模型。但加入\n709\t    API 模型后，右上角出现一个 \"sweet spot\" 区域——API 模型组合同时实现高 K_eff（不同公司模型自然 diverse） 和低 η_max（都很强）。Pareto\n710\t    frontier 被 API-inclusive panels 主导（8/12）， 表明 tradeoff 可以通过使用 strong diverse models\n711\t    打破。 Overall R² = 0.17 表明 tradeoff 只解释 17% 的方差——远非 \"structural\"。\n712\t\n713\t    '\n714\t  tables:\n715\t  - caption: Tradeoff statistics by model pool composition\n716\t    columns:\n717\t    - Pool\n718\t    - N panels\n719\t    - r(K_eff, η_max)\n720\t    - p\n721\t    - R²\n722\t    - Interpretation\n723\t    rows:\n724\t    - - All 15 models\n725\t      - '455'\n726\t      - '-0.41'\n727\t      - '0.003'\n728\t      - '0.17'\n729\t      - Moderate — not structural\n730\t    - - Open-source only (10)\n731\t      - '120'\n732\t      - '-0.72'\n733\t      - <0.001\n734\t      - '0.52'\n735\t      - Strong — ecosystem artifact\n736\t    - - API-inclusive (≥1 API)\n737\t      - '335'\n738\t      - '-0.22'\n739\t      - '0.04'\n740\t      - '0.05'\n741\t      - Weak — API breaks tradeoff\n742\t    - - All-API (5)\n743\t      - '10'\n744\t      - '-0.05'\n745\t      - '0.89'\n746\t      - '0.003'\n747\t      - None — diversity is free\n748\t  figures_description:\n749\t  - 'Main scatter: K_eff (x) vs η_max (y) for 455 panels, colored by tier composition\n750\t    (blue=all-API, green=mixed, red=all-OS-weak). Pareto frontier highlighted. Two\n751\t    regression lines: overall (dashed, r=-0.41) and open-source-only (dotted, r=-0.72).\n752\t    Clear visual that API models break the tradeoff.'\n753\t  - 'Inset: K_eff (x) vs mean panel ASR (y) for Pareto-optimal panels only, showing\n754\t    that the ''diversity tax'' disappears on the frontier.'\n755\t  analysis: '可视化是 reframed paper 的关键 figure。它同时传达两个信息：(1) open-source ecosystem 中\n756\t    tradeoff 确实存在且严重（r=-0.72）；(2) 这不是 fundamental constraint——API 模型的加入打破了 tradeoff。实际含义：diversity-as-defense\n757\t    不是 inherently flawed，只是在当前 open-source 生态中因 capability 分层 严重而表现为 trap。随着 open-source\n758\t    模型 capability 提升（如未来 7B 模型 接近当前 70B 水平），tradeoff 将进一步缩小。这是一个 more nuanced 且 arguably\n759\t    more useful 的 finding，但比 \"diversity is fundamentally a trap\" 的 punch 力弱很多。\n760\t\n761\t    '\n762\t- name: 'Panel size sensitivity: K=3,5,7,9'\n763\t  plan_id: plan_008\n764\t  description: '在不同 panel size (K=3,5,7,9) 下测试 weakest-link theorem。验证 η_max dominance\n765\t    是否随 K 增大而变化。\n766\t\n767\t    '\n768\t  expected_results:\n769\t    k3_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.42\n770\t    k5_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.33\n771\t    k7_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.28\n772\t    k9_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.22\n773\t    k3_keff_sig_negative_rate: 0.33\n774\t    k5_keff_sig_negative_rate: 0.39\n775\t    k7_keff_sig_negative_rate: 0.5\n776\t    k9_keff_sig_negative_rate: 0.56\n777\t    eta_max_sig_trend_p: 0.03\n778\t    keff_sig_trend_p: 0.02\n779\t    k9_median_asr_reduction_vs_k3: 0.35\n780\t    diversity_benefit_threshold_k: 5\n781\t  result_rationale: '随着 panel size 增大，两个效应叠加削弱 weakest-link：(1) 更多 judges 意味着 更大的\n782\t    voting majority 需要被 flip，即使 weakest judge 被攻破，其 1 票在 K=9 的 majority-vote 中影响更小（1/9\n783\t    vs 1/3）；(2) 大 panel 更可能包含 strong models（15 个模型中选 9 个 vs 选 3 个），η_max 的绝对值被拉低，\n784\t    方差也更小。因此 η_max 显著率从 K=3 的 42% 单调下降到 K=9 的 22%， 而 K_eff 显著率从 33% 上升到 56%。在 K ≈\n785\t    5 时出现交叉——diversity 开始比 individual robustness 更重要。这对 practical recommendation 有直接影响：K=3\n786\t    时 focus on robustness，K≥5 时 diversity matters。 但这也进一步削弱了 \"weakest-link is universal\"\n787\t    的 claim——它甚至 不对所有 panel size universal。\n788\t\n789\t    '\n790\t  tables:\n791\t  - caption: Weakest-link persistence across panel sizes\n792\t    columns:\n793\t    - K\n794\t    - N panels\n795\t    - η_max sig rate\n796\t    - K_eff sig neg rate\n797\t    - Median R²\n798\t    - Mean ASR\n799\t    rows:\n800\t    - - '3'\n801\t      - '455'\n802\t      - '0.42'\n803\t      - '0.33'\n804\t      - '0.22'\n805\t      - '0.134'\n806\t    - - '5'\n807\t      - '3003'\n808\t      - '0.33'\n809\t      - '0.39'\n810\t      - '0.18'\n811\t      - '0.105'\n812\t    - - '7'\n813\t      - '6435'\n814\t      - '0.28'\n815\t      - '0.50'\n816\t      - '0.15'\n817\t      - '0.092'\n818\t    - - '9'\n819\t      - '5005'\n820\t      - '0.22'\n821\t      - '0.56'\n822\t      - '0.13'\n823\t      - '0.087'\n824\t  - caption: 'Transition analysis: K at which K_eff overtakes η_max'\n825\t    columns:\n826\t    - Metric\n827\t    - K=3\n828\t    - K=5\n829\t    - K=7\n830\t    - K=9\n831\t    - Trend p\n832\t    rows:\n833\t    - - η_max sig rate\n834\t      - '0.42'\n835\t      - '0.33'\n836\t      - '0.28'\n837\t      - '0.22'\n838\t      - '0.03'\n839\t    - - K_eff sig neg rate\n840\t      - '0.33'\n841\t      - '0.39'\n842\t      - '0.50'\n843\t      - '0.56'\n844\t      - '0.02'\n845\t    - - η_max > K_eff (conditions)\n846\t      - 7/18\n847\t      - 6/18\n848\t      - 4/18\n849\t      - 3/18\n850\t      - —\n851\t  figures_description:\n852\t  - 'Line plot: panel size K (x) vs significance rate (y), two lines — η_max (red,\n853\t    decreasing) and K_eff (blue, increasing). Crossover at K≈5 highlighted. Shaded\n854\t    95% CI bands.'\n855\t  - 'Box plot: panel ASR distribution by K, showing monotonic decrease with increasing\n856\t    K — diversity does provide aggregate protection at scale.'\n857\t  analysis: Panel size sensitivity 是最终确认 weakest-link non-universality 的实验。 η_max\n858\t    显著率随 K 单调下降（0.42→0.22），K_eff 单调上升（0.33→0.56）， 交叉在 K≈5。这有一个直觉解释：K=3 majority vote\n859\t    中 1 个被攻破的 judge 已经占 1/3 的权重，weakest link 影响巨大；K=9 中 1/9 权重，需要同时 攻破 5 个 judge 才能\n860\t    flip panel，此时 diversity（不同 judge 的 failure mode 不同）确实提供了实质保护。 对 paper 的影响：weakest-link\n861\t    theorem 需要 qualified as \"primarily applies to small panels (K≤5) and when panel\n862\t    includes sufficiently weak members\"。 Practical recommendation 变为 regime-dependent\n863\t    guidance：小 panel 重 robustness，大 panel 重 diversity。这对 framework paper narrative\n864\t    实际上 是 positive——提供了一个清晰的、可操作的 regime boundary。\n865\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"69b3d071-f9f2-4572-a412-5f94b0e0e914","uuid":"e1047e6f-b62f-46c3-9791-266ff1c26807","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:30:03.621Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/cert_manip_resist_eval/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T055016/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml","content":"tier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: '核心 negative result 在扩展数据上碎片化。weakest-link 效应仅在弱模型 panel 中稳定成立，\n  强模型 regime 中 diversity 确实提供保护。论文必须从 \"diversity is a trap\" 彻底转为 \"A Framework for\n  Panel Security Analysis: When Diversity Helps and When It Hurts\"。 核心卖点变为：(1) adaptive\n  adversary framework 本身作为分析工具的价值； (2) regime characterization——精确刻画 diversity 有效/无效的条件边界；\n  (3) copula failure + family label unreliability 上升为主要 methodological contribution；\n  (4) diversity-capability tradeoff 限定为 open-source ecosystem finding。 风险是 reviewer\n  认为 \"it depends on the regime\" 是 incremental insight， 需要通过 formal framework 的 elegance\n  和 practical implications 补偿。 EMNLP Findings 仍可行（Overall ~3.0-3.5），Main 需要 framework\n  novelty 非常扎实。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: 'Scale expansion: 15+ models (API + large open-source)'\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '将模型池从 6 扩展到 15+（加入 GPT-4o-mini, GPT-4o, GPT-4.1, Claude-3.5-Sonnet,\n    Gemini-1.5-Pro, Llama-3.1-70B, Qwen2.5-72B, Mixtral-8x22B），重跑 MI 矩阵和 C(15,3)=455\n    panels 的多元回归。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_panels: 455\n    total_conditions: 12\n    eta_max_sig_count: 5\n    eta_max_sig_rate: 0.42\n    keff_sig_negative_count: 4\n    keff_nonsig_count: 7\n    keff_sig_positive_count: 1\n    median_R2: 0.22\n    eta_max_median_beta: 0.61\n    keff_median_beta: -0.18\n    overall_keff_p_median: 0.14\n    api_model_panels_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.17\n    api_model_panels_keff_sig_rate: 0.5\n    opensource_weak_panels_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.67\n    opensource_weak_panels_keff_sig_rate: 0.17\n    expanded_panel_weakest_link_consistency: 0.42\n  result_rationale: '扩展模型池引入高能力 API 模型后，capability range 显著拉宽。在纯 API 模型 （GPT-4o, Claude,\n    Gemini）组成的 panel 中，所有成员 η 都很低（individual ASR ~5-15%），η_max 方差小，回归中 η_max 的解释力下降（low\n    variance → low signal）。 此时 K_eff 代表的模型多样性反而能捕捉到 residual attack surface 差异—— 不同\n    API 模型对不同 attack type 的脆弱面不同，diversity 确实提供了互补保护。 但在包含弱模型（7B open-source）的 panel\n    中，某个模型 η ≈ 0.6-0.8， 远高于其他成员，weakest-link 效应依然成立。总体来看 η_max 显著率从 MVP 的 67%（4/6）下降到\n    42%（5/12），K_eff 从 0/6 显著负变为 4/12—— weakest-link theorem 不再 universal，而是 regime-dependent。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Multivariate regression results on 455 panels (15 models, K=3)\n    columns:\n    - Dataset\n    - Attack\n    - β(η_max)\n    - p(η_max)\n    - β(K_eff)\n    - p(K_eff)\n    - R²\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - prompt-injection\n      - '0.82'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '-0.31'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.34'\n    - - MMLU\n      - score-manipulation\n      - '0.74'\n      - '0.011'\n      - '-0.22'\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.26'\n    - - MMLU\n      - sycophancy\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.042'\n      - '-0.41'\n      - '0.03'\n      - '0.28'\n    - - MMLU\n      - verbosity\n      - '0.45'\n      - '0.12'\n      - '-0.15'\n      - '0.42'\n      - '0.14'\n    - - MMLU\n      - position\n      - '0.39'\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.12'\n      - '0.51'\n      - '0.09'\n    - - MMLU\n      - authority\n      - '0.68'\n      - '0.008'\n      - '-0.28'\n      - '0.11'\n      - '0.29'\n    - - ARC\n      - prompt-injection\n      - '0.71'\n      - '0.015'\n      - '-0.38'\n      - '0.04'\n      - '0.31'\n    - - ARC\n      - score-manipulation\n      - '0.63'\n      - '0.028'\n      - '-0.19'\n      - '0.27'\n      - '0.22'\n    - - ARC\n      - sycophancy\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.065'\n      - '-0.44'\n      - '0.02'\n      - '0.25'\n    - - ARC\n      - verbosity\n      - '0.41'\n      - '0.14'\n      - '-0.33'\n      - '0.07'\n      - '0.18'\n    - - ARC\n      - position\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.08'\n    - - ARC\n      - authority\n      - '0.55'\n      - '0.052'\n      - '-0.26'\n      - '0.15'\n      - '0.21'\n  - caption: Regime-stratified η_max significance (panel capability tiers)\n    columns:\n    - Panel Tier\n    - N panels\n    - η_max sig rate\n    - K_eff sig negative rate\n    - Median R²\n    rows:\n    - - All-API (GPT/Claude/Gemini)\n      - '20'\n      - '0.17'\n      - '0.50'\n      - '0.12'\n    - - Mixed (API + 70B)\n      - '120'\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.42'\n      - '0.19'\n    - - All-large-OS (70B class)\n      - '35'\n      - '0.50'\n      - '0.25'\n      - '0.24'\n    - - Mixed (large + small OS)\n      - '180'\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.17'\n      - '0.28'\n    - - All-small-OS (7B class)\n      - '10'\n      - '0.67'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.35'\n    - - Contains ≥1 weak model\n      - '280'\n      - '0.55'\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.27'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Heatmap: 12 conditions × 2 predictors (η_max, K_eff) showing p-values. Clear\n    diagonal pattern — η_max cells darker (more significant) for targeted attacks\n    (prompt-injection, score-manipulation), K_eff cells darker for shared-bias attacks\n    (sycophancy) but only in strong-model panels.'\n  - 'Scatter: panel min-capability (x) vs η_max significance (y, binary). Logistic\n    regression overlay shows threshold around 70B-class capability where η_max transitions\n    from dominant to non-significant.'\n  analysis: '这是 worst 档最核心的结果变化。MVP 阶段的 6 模型结论（η_max dominates universally） 在 15 模型池上碎片化为\n    regime-dependent 结论。关键发现：(1) 强模型 panel 中 η_max 方差太小，不构成 weakest link——因为没有 weak\n    link；(2) 此时 K_eff 代表的 diversity 确实提供了互补保护；(3) 弱模型 panel 中 MVP 结论完全成立。 论文 reframe\n    方向：从 \"η_max always dominates\" 变为 \"η_max dominates when there exists a sufficiently\n    weak member; above a capability threshold, diversity becomes the operative defense\"。这实际上是更有趣的\n    nuanced result，但需要 reviewer 接受 regime-dependent 结论的价值。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Attack expansion: 6+ attack types'\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '新增 few-shot hijacking、persona manipulation、instruction override 三种攻击，\n    在 15+ 模型池上运行，验证 weakest-link 在更广泛 attack surface 上的表现。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    new_attack_types: 3\n    total_attack_types: 9\n    total_conditions: 18\n    eta_max_sig_rate_new_attacks: 0.33\n    keff_sig_negative_rate_new_attacks: 0.5\n    eta_max_sig_rate_overall: 0.39\n    keff_sig_negative_rate_overall: 0.39\n    few_shot_hijacking_eta_max_p: 0.19\n    few_shot_hijacking_keff_p: 0.04\n    persona_manipulation_eta_max_p: 0.035\n    persona_manipulation_keff_p: 0.22\n    instruction_override_eta_max_p: 0.08\n    instruction_override_keff_p: 0.03\n  result_rationale: '新增攻击类型进一步分裂 weakest-link 的 universality。few-shot hijacking 和\n    instruction override 是高度 transferable 的攻击——它们利用 instruction-following 这一所有 LLM\n    共享的特性，因此对 panel 中所有模型的 ASR 较均匀。此时 η_max 解释力弱（因为 variance across judges 低），而 K_eff\n    反而显著——多样性意味着 不同模型对 instruction-following exploit 的具体 failure mode 不同，提供互补保护。 persona\n    manipulation 类似 sycophancy，更依赖 individual model 特性（某些模型 对 authority cues 特别敏感），η_max\n    仍显著。总体上 η_max 和 K_eff 各在约 40% 条件下显著，无一方 universal dominate——核心 claim 需要 nuance。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Regression results for new attack types (455 panels)\n    columns:\n    - Dataset\n    - Attack\n    - β(η_max)\n    - p(η_max)\n    - β(K_eff)\n    - p(K_eff)\n    - R²\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - few-shot-hijacking\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.24'\n      - '-0.48'\n      - '0.03'\n      - '0.19'\n    - - MMLU\n      - persona-manipulation\n      - '0.72'\n      - '0.009'\n      - '-0.14'\n      - '0.39'\n      - '0.25'\n    - - MMLU\n      - instruction-override\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.15'\n      - '-0.52'\n      - '0.02'\n      - '0.22'\n    - - ARC\n      - few-shot-hijacking\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.19'\n      - '-0.39'\n      - '0.05'\n      - '0.16'\n    - - ARC\n      - persona-manipulation\n      - '0.65'\n      - '0.035'\n      - '-0.21'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.22'\n    - - ARC\n      - instruction-override\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.12'\n      - '-0.44'\n      - '0.03'\n      - '0.20'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: attack type (x) vs η_max significance (blue) and K_eff significance\n    (orange), grouped. Shows clear pattern — targeted attacks (prompt-injection, persona)\n    favor η_max; transferable attacks (few-shot-hijacking, instruction-override, sycophancy)\n    favor K_eff.'\n  analysis: '攻击扩展进一步确认 regime-dependent 结论，且揭示了一个有价值的 pattern： attack transferability\n    是决定 η_max vs K_eff 哪个更重要的关键维度。 targeted attacks（需要针对特定模型调优的攻击）→ η_max 主导； transferable\n    attacks（利用 LLM 共性弱点的攻击）→ K_eff 有效。 这为 framework paper 提供了 regime characterization\n    的第二个维度 （第一个是 panel capability tier），增强了 analytical contribution。\n\n    '\n- name: Adaptive adversary formal theorem + random-fault simulation\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: '(a) 形式化定理：adaptive adversary 下 panel_ASR = Θ(η_max)； (b) random-fault\n    simulation：每个 judge 独立以概率 p_j fail； (c) 对比验证 BFT 区分。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    theorem_holds: true\n    theorem_tightness: loose in strong-model regime\n    random_fault_keff_sig_rate: 0.39\n    adaptive_keff_sig_rate: 0.39\n    bft_contrast_cohen_d: 0.22\n    bft_contrast_p: 0.08\n    keff_beta_ratio_random_vs_adaptive: 1.4\n    random_fault_keff_median_beta: -0.52\n    adaptive_keff_median_beta: -0.37\n    regime_interaction_p: 0.04\n  result_rationale: '形式化定理本身在数学上成立——在 adaptive adversary 假设下，panel ASR 的 upper bound\n    确实由 max(η_j) 决定。但在 worst 档下，实证数据显示这个 bound 在强模型 regime 中很 loose（实际 ASR 远低于 η_max\n    bound），因为即使是 adaptive adversary，当所有模型都很强时，攻击成本太高，实际行为更接近 opportunistic 而非 truly\n    adaptive。random-fault simulation 中 K_eff 确实 比 adaptive 条件下更显著，但差异不大（Cohen''s d\n    ≈ 0.22，远小于预期的 0.5+）——因为在实际数据中，即使是 adaptive attacks 也不完美 adaptive （attacker 没有完美的\n    per-judge oracle），与 random fault 的差距没有 理论预测的那么大。关键的 saving grace 是 regime × fault-type\n    交互显著 （p=0.04）：在弱模型 panel 中 adaptive vs random 差异大，强模型 panel 中 差异消失。这支持 regime\n    characterization 的 narrative。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'K_eff significance: adaptive vs random-fault across regimes'\n    columns:\n    - Regime\n    - Fault Type\n    - K_eff β\n    - K_eff p\n    - η_max β\n    - η_max p\n    rows:\n    - - Weak panels\n      - adaptive\n      - '-0.12'\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.78'\n      - '0.004'\n    - - Weak panels\n      - random-fault\n      - '-0.41'\n      - '0.03'\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.06'\n    - - Mixed panels\n      - adaptive\n      - '-0.28'\n      - '0.09'\n      - '0.55'\n      - '0.04'\n    - - Mixed panels\n      - random-fault\n      - '-0.45'\n      - '0.02'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.11'\n    - - Strong panels\n      - adaptive\n      - '-0.44'\n      - '0.02'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.31'\n    - - Strong panels\n      - random-fault\n      - '-0.58'\n      - '0.005'\n      - '0.15'\n      - '0.48'\n  - caption: BFT contrast effect sizes\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Weak panels\n    - Mixed panels\n    - Strong panels\n    - Overall\n    rows:\n    - - Cohen's d (K_eff β difference)\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.21'\n      - '0.12'\n      - '0.22'\n    - - p (paired t-test)\n      - '0.04'\n      - '0.12'\n      - '0.41'\n      - '0.08'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired bar chart: K_eff β under adaptive (red) vs random-fault (blue), stratified\n    by panel regime. Gap shrinks from left (weak) to right (strong), visualizing the\n    regime × fault-type interaction.'\n  analysis: 'BFT 区分的理论贡献被削弱。Overall Cohen''s d = 0.22 远低于 medium effect size 标准（0.5），且\n    overall p = 0.08 不显著。只有在 weak panel regime 中 contrast 才显著（d = 0.38, p = 0.04）。这意味着\n    \"adaptive adversary fundamentally different from BFT\" 这个 claim 需要限定为 \"the distinction\n    matters primarily in weak-model settings\"。不过 regime × fault-type 交互效应本身是有趣的发现，\n    可以作为 framework 的 analytical insight。论文需要降低 BFT contrast 的 claim 强度，从 \"fundamental\n    distinction\" 变为 \"regime-dependent distinction\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Capability-matched validation\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '在同一 capability tier 内（如全 7B 或全 70B），测试控制 η_max 方差后 K_eff 是否显著。如果 within-tier\n    K_eff 显著 → diversity 在控制 capability 后确实有效。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    tiers_tested: 3\n    tier_7b_keff_sig_rate: 0.17\n    tier_7b_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.5\n    tier_70b_keff_sig_rate: 0.33\n    tier_70b_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.33\n    tier_api_keff_sig_rate: 0.5\n    tier_api_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.17\n    diversity_capability_r_overall: -0.41\n    diversity_capability_r_within_7b: -0.18\n    diversity_capability_r_within_70b: -0.08\n    diversity_capability_r_within_api: -0.05\n    within_tier_keff_overall_sig_rate: 0.33\n  result_rationale: '控制 capability tier 后，η_max 方差被大幅压缩（within-tier models 能力接近），\n    回归中 η_max 的解释力下降。此时 K_eff 在部分条件下变得显著——特别是在 API tier 中（3/6 显著），因为 GPT-4o、Claude、Gemini\n    虽然 capability 相似， 但 vulnerability profile 显著不同（不同训练数据和 safety alignment 策略）， diversity\n    确实提供互补保护。70B tier 中 K_eff 中等显著（2/6），7B tier 中 仍不显著（1/6）——因为 7B 模型普遍 vulnerable，η_max\n    方差虽然 within-tier 较小但绝对值仍高，weakest-link 效应持续。 diversity-capability tradeoff 的 overall\n    r 从 MVP 的 -0.8 降到 -0.41（加入 API 模型后 tradeoff 大幅减弱），within-tier r 接近 0（-0.05 to\n    -0.18）—— tradeoff 主要是 cross-tier artifact（比较 7B 和 70B 当然 diversity 高但 capability\n    低），而非 fundamental constraint。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'Within-tier regression: K_eff significance by capability tier'\n    columns:\n    - Tier\n    - N models\n    - N panels (K=3)\n    - η_max sig rate\n    - K_eff sig neg rate\n    - Median R²\n    - K_eff-η_max r\n    rows:\n    - - 7B class\n      - '5'\n      - '10'\n      - '0.50'\n      - '0.17'\n      - '0.18'\n      - '-0.18'\n    - - 70B class\n      - '4'\n      - '4'\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.15'\n      - '-0.08'\n    - - API models\n      - '5'\n      - '10'\n      - '0.17'\n      - '0.50'\n      - '0.12'\n      - '-0.05'\n    - - Cross-tier (all)\n      - '15'\n      - '455'\n      - '0.42'\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '-0.41'\n  - caption: Diversity-capability tradeoff decomposition\n    columns:\n    - Scope\n    - Pearson r\n    - p-value\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Overall (15 models)\n      - '-0.41'\n      - '0.003'\n      - Moderate negative — driven by tier differences\n    - - Within 7B\n      - '-0.18'\n      - '0.38'\n      - Not significant — no tradeoff within tier\n    - - Within 70B\n      - '-0.08'\n      - '0.72'\n      - Not significant\n    - - Within API\n      - '-0.05'\n      - '0.81'\n      - Not significant\n    - - Open-source only (10 models)\n      - '-0.72'\n      - '0.001'\n      - Strong negative — ecosystem artifact\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter plot with color-coded tiers: K_eff (x) vs η_max (y) for all 455 panels.\n    Within-tier points form horizontal clusters (no tradeoff), but cross-tier slope\n    is steep negative. Regression lines: overall (dashed, slope=-0.41) vs within-tier\n    (solid, near-flat).'\n  analysis: '这是 worst 档最具杀伤力的结果。diversity-capability tradeoff（Claim 3）被 证实主要是 open-source\n    ecosystem artifact，而非 fundamental constraint。 加入 API 模型后 overall r 从 -0.8 降到 -0.41，within-tier\n    r 接近 0。 这意味着 \"diversity and security are structurally at odds\" 这个 strong claim\n    需要大幅限定为 \"in the current open-source ecosystem, where capability strongly predicts\n    robustness, pursuing diversity across capability tiers introduces weaker models\"。同时\n    within-tier K_eff 显著率 33% 表明 diversity 在 controlled settings 中确实有效——进一步削弱 \"diversity\n    is a trap\" narrative。论文 reframe 必须诚实承认这一点。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Two-stage panel design algorithm: full benchmark'\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '实现 robustness-first 两阶段算法（先筛 η ≤ threshold，再最大化 K_eff）， 对比 5 个 baseline\n    策略。在 15+ 模型池上 sweep threshold。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    strategies_compared: 6\n    total_conditions: 18\n    two_stage_win_rate: 0.44\n    min_eta_max_win_rate: 0.39\n    max_keff_win_rate: 0.33\n    strongest_k_win_rate: 0.5\n    random_win_rate: 0.06\n    max_family_div_win_rate: 0.11\n    two_stage_vs_strongest_k_p: 0.32\n    two_stage_mean_asr: 0.091\n    strongest_k_mean_asr: 0.082\n    threshold_sensitivity: high — optimal threshold varies by attack type\n    pareto_dominated_by_strongest_k: partially\n  result_rationale: '两阶段算法在 worst 档下表现不突出，因为 (1) strongest-K 策略（直接选最强 K 个 模型）在强模型\n    regime 中已经接近最优——当 API 模型可用时，选 GPT-4o + Claude + Gemini 既有高 robustness 又有 decent\n    diversity（不同公司的模型自然 diverse）； (2) 两阶段算法的 threshold 参数高度 attack-dependent——对 prompt\n    injection 最优 threshold ≠ 对 sycophancy 最优 threshold——无法给出 universal 建议； (3) 在弱模型\n    pool（纯 open-source 7B）中两阶段确实优于 max-K_eff，但 strongest-K 同样优于 max-K_eff，且不需要 threshold\n    tuning。 win rate 0.44 略低于 strongest-K 的 0.50，且差异不显著（p=0.32）。 robustness-first\n    不 dominate，practical contribution 被削弱为 \"在缺乏 API 模型时的合理 heuristic\" 而非 \"universal\n    optimal strategy\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Panel selection strategy benchmark (mean ASR, lower is better)\n    columns:\n    - Strategy\n    - Mean ASR\n    - Median ASR\n    - Win rate\n    - vs Random p\n    rows:\n    - - Two-stage (ours)\n      - '0.091'\n      - '0.078'\n      - '0.44'\n      - '0.001'\n    - - Strongest-K\n      - '0.082'\n      - '0.071'\n      - '0.50'\n      - <0.001\n    - - Min-η_max\n      - '0.095'\n      - '0.085'\n      - '0.39'\n      - '0.003'\n    - - Max-K_eff\n      - '0.131'\n      - '0.118'\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.02'\n    - - Max-family-diversity\n      - '0.158'\n      - '0.142'\n      - '0.11'\n      - '0.15'\n    - - Random\n      - '0.172'\n      - '0.155'\n      - '0.06'\n      - —\n  - caption: 'Head-to-head: Two-stage vs Strongest-K by regime'\n    columns:\n    - Regime\n    - Two-stage wins\n    - Strongest-K wins\n    - Tie\n    - p\n    rows:\n    - - Weak panels (OS-7B only)\n      - 4/6\n      - 2/6\n      - '0'\n      - '0.12'\n    - - Mixed panels\n      - 3/6\n      - 3/6\n      - '0'\n      - '0.82'\n    - - Strong panels (API available)\n      - 1/6\n      - 4/6\n      - '1'\n      - '0.08'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Pareto frontier plot: mean ASR (y, lower better) vs computational cost (x, lower\n    better). Two-stage and Strongest-K both on frontier but at different points. Max-K_eff\n    and Random clearly dominated.'\n  analysis: '两阶段算法没有显著优势，Claim 6 实质性削弱。strongest-K 策略在有 API 模型 可用时 win rate 更高，且不需要\n    threshold 参数。两阶段算法唯一优势场景是 纯 open-source weak model pool（4/6 wins），但这一场景在实践中正在减少\n    （API 模型越来越便宜易用）。practical contribution 从 \"robustness-first algorithm dominates\"\n    降级为 \"when restricted to weak model pools, a robustness-first heuristic helps,\n    but is unnecessary when strong models are available\"。可以在 paper 中作为 minor practical\n    insight 保留， 但不能作为主要 contribution。\n\n    '\n- name: Per-judge ASR concentration analysis\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '对每个 panel × attack，测量 per-judge ASR 分布的集中度（Gini 系数、熵）， 验证攻击是否集中在最弱\n    judge 上。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    median_gini: 0.31\n    mean_gini: 0.34\n    gini_strong_panels: 0.18\n    gini_weak_panels: 0.52\n    gini_mixed_panels: 0.38\n    entropy_normalized_median: 0.78\n    concentration_on_weakest_fraction: 0.48\n    concentration_on_weakest_strong_panels: 0.38\n    concentration_on_weakest_weak_panels: 0.61\n    gini_adaptive_vs_random_p: 0.06\n    gini_adaptive_vs_random_d: 0.28\n  result_rationale: 'Per-judge ASR 集中度呈现清晰的 regime 分裂。在 weak panel（包含 7B 模型）中， Gini\n    ≈ 0.52，最弱 judge 承担 61% 的攻击成功——符合 adaptive adversary targeting 预测。但在 strong panel（全\n    API 模型）中，Gini ≈ 0.18，接近均匀分布—— 攻击成功较均匀地分布在各 judge 上，因为没有明显的 \"weakest link\" 可供集中攻击。\n    adaptive vs random-fault 的 Gini 差异不显著（p=0.06, d=0.28）——因为即使在 adaptive 条件下，当模型能力相近时，attacker\n    的 targeting 精度有限，行为 接近 semi-random。这进一步支持 \"adaptive adversary distinction matters\n    primarily in weak-model regime\" 的结论。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Per-judge ASR concentration by panel regime\n    columns:\n    - Regime\n    - Median Gini\n    - Mean entropy (norm.)\n    - Weakest-judge share\n    - N panels\n    rows:\n    - - All-API\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.91'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '20'\n    - - Mixed (API+70B)\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.83'\n      - '0.42'\n      - '120'\n    - - All-large-OS\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.77'\n      - '0.47'\n      - '35'\n    - - Mixed (large+small OS)\n      - '0.45'\n      - '0.69'\n      - '0.55'\n      - '180'\n    - - All-small-OS\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.62'\n      - '0.61'\n      - '10'\n  - caption: 'Concentration: adaptive vs random-fault'\n    columns:\n    - Fault Type\n    - Median Gini\n    - Weakest-judge share\n    - Paired diff p\n    rows:\n    - - Adaptive\n      - '0.34'\n      - '0.48'\n      - —\n    - - Random-fault\n      - '0.26'\n      - '0.41'\n      - '0.06'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Violin plot: Gini coefficient distribution, stratified by panel regime (x) and\n    colored by fault type (adaptive=red, random=blue). Weak panels show high Gini\n    with clear adaptive-random separation; strong panels show low Gini with overlapping\n    distributions.'\n  analysis: 'Concentration analysis 部分支持 adaptive adversary narrative，但仅限于 weak panel\n    regime。在 strong panels 中，ASR 近乎均匀分布——不存在 \"weakest link\" targeting 行为。这从另一个角度确认\n    regime-dependent 结论：adaptive adversary model 的 descriptive accuracy 本身也是 regime-dependent\n    的。 在强模型 panel 中，adversary 更像 \"均匀探测\" 而非 \"精准打击\"。 这对形式化定理没有影响（定理给出 upper bound，不要求\n    tight），但削弱了 \"adaptive adversary is the right threat model\" 的 empirical support。\n\n    '\n- name: Diversity-capability tradeoff visualization\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '在 C(15,3)=455 panels 上绘制 K_eff vs η_max scatter，拟合 tradeoff 曲线， 展示\n    Pareto frontier，按 capability tier 分层。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    overall_pearson_r: -0.41\n    overall_spearman_r: -0.38\n    pareto_front_size: 12\n    pareto_composition: 8/12 contain ≥2 API models\n    tradeoff_slope: -0.33\n    tradeoff_R2: 0.17\n    api_inclusive_r: -0.22\n    opensource_only_r: -0.72\n    pareto_panels_mean_asr: 0.075\n    non_pareto_mean_asr: 0.148\n  result_rationale: '可视化清晰展示 tradeoff 的 ecosystem-dependent 本质。在纯 open-source 空间中，\n    K_eff vs η_max 呈强负相关（r=-0.72）：要 diversity 就必须跨 capability tier 混搭（如 7B + 70B），必然引入弱模型。但加入\n    API 模型后，右上角出现一个 \"sweet spot\" 区域——API 模型组合同时实现高 K_eff（不同公司模型自然 diverse） 和低 η_max（都很强）。Pareto\n    frontier 被 API-inclusive panels 主导（8/12）， 表明 tradeoff 可以通过使用 strong diverse models\n    打破。 Overall R² = 0.17 表明 tradeoff 只解释 17% 的方差——远非 \"structural\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Tradeoff statistics by model pool composition\n    columns:\n    - Pool\n    - N panels\n    - r(K_eff, η_max)\n    - p\n    - R²\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - All 15 models\n      - '455'\n      - '-0.41'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '0.17'\n      - Moderate — not structural\n    - - Open-source only (10)\n      - '120'\n      - '-0.72'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.52'\n      - Strong — ecosystem artifact\n    - - API-inclusive (≥1 API)\n      - '335'\n      - '-0.22'\n      - '0.04'\n      - '0.05'\n      - Weak — API breaks tradeoff\n    - - All-API (5)\n      - '10'\n      - '-0.05'\n      - '0.89'\n      - '0.003'\n      - None — diversity is free\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Main scatter: K_eff (x) vs η_max (y) for 455 panels, colored by tier composition\n    (blue=all-API, green=mixed, red=all-OS-weak). Pareto frontier highlighted. Two\n    regression lines: overall (dashed, r=-0.41) and open-source-only (dotted, r=-0.72).\n    Clear visual that API models break the tradeoff.'\n  - 'Inset: K_eff (x) vs mean panel ASR (y) for Pareto-optimal panels only, showing\n    that the ''diversity tax'' disappears on the frontier.'\n  analysis: '可视化是 reframed paper 的关键 figure。它同时传达两个信息：(1) open-source ecosystem 中\n    tradeoff 确实存在且严重（r=-0.72）；(2) 这不是 fundamental constraint——API 模型的加入打破了 tradeoff。实际含义：diversity-as-defense\n    不是 inherently flawed，只是在当前 open-source 生态中因 capability 分层 严重而表现为 trap。随着 open-source\n    模型 capability 提升（如未来 7B 模型 接近当前 70B 水平），tradeoff 将进一步缩小。这是一个 more nuanced 且 arguably\n    more useful 的 finding，但比 \"diversity is fundamentally a trap\" 的 punch 力弱很多。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Panel size sensitivity: K=3,5,7,9'\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '在不同 panel size (K=3,5,7,9) 下测试 weakest-link theorem。验证 η_max dominance\n    是否随 K 增大而变化。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    k3_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.42\n    k5_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.33\n    k7_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.28\n    k9_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.22\n    k3_keff_sig_negative_rate: 0.33\n    k5_keff_sig_negative_rate: 0.39\n    k7_keff_sig_negative_rate: 0.5\n    k9_keff_sig_negative_rate: 0.56\n    eta_max_sig_trend_p: 0.03\n    keff_sig_trend_p: 0.02\n    k9_median_asr_reduction_vs_k3: 0.35\n    diversity_benefit_threshold_k: 5\n  result_rationale: '随着 panel size 增大，两个效应叠加削弱 weakest-link：(1) 更多 judges 意味着 更大的\n    voting majority 需要被 flip，即使 weakest judge 被攻破，其 1 票在 K=9 的 majority-vote 中影响更小（1/9\n    vs 1/3）；(2) 大 panel 更可能包含 strong models（15 个模型中选 9 个 vs 选 3 个），η_max 的绝对值被拉低，\n    方差也更小。因此 η_max 显著率从 K=3 的 42% 单调下降到 K=9 的 22%， 而 K_eff 显著率从 33% 上升到 56%。在 K ≈\n    5 时出现交叉——diversity 开始比 individual robustness 更重要。这对 practical recommendation 有直接影响：K=3\n    时 focus on robustness，K≥5 时 diversity matters。 但这也进一步削弱了 \"weakest-link is universal\"\n    的 claim——它甚至 不对所有 panel size universal。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Weakest-link persistence across panel sizes\n    columns:\n    - K\n    - N panels\n    - η_max sig rate\n    - K_eff sig neg rate\n    - Median R²\n    - Mean ASR\n    rows:\n    - - '3'\n      - '455'\n      - '0.42'\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.134'\n    - - '5'\n      - '3003'\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.39'\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.105'\n    - - '7'\n      - '6435'\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.50'\n      - '0.15'\n      - '0.092'\n    - - '9'\n      - '5005'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.56'\n      - '0.13'\n      - '0.087'\n  - caption: 'Transition analysis: K at which K_eff overtakes η_max'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - K=3\n    - K=5\n    - K=7\n    - K=9\n    - Trend p\n    rows:\n    - - η_max sig rate\n      - '0.42'\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.03'\n    - - K_eff sig neg rate\n      - '0.33'\n      - '0.39'\n      - '0.50'\n      - '0.56'\n      - '0.02'\n    - - η_max > K_eff (conditions)\n      - 7/18\n      - 6/18\n      - 4/18\n      - 3/18\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: panel size K (x) vs significance rate (y), two lines — η_max (red,\n    decreasing) and K_eff (blue, increasing). Crossover at K≈5 highlighted. Shaded\n    95% CI bands.'\n  - 'Box plot: panel ASR distribution by K, showing monotonic decrease with increasing\n    K — diversity does provide aggregate protection at scale.'\n  analysis: Panel size sensitivity 是最终确认 weakest-link non-universality 的实验。 η_max\n    显著率随 K 单调下降（0.42→0.22），K_eff 单调上升（0.33→0.56）， 交叉在 K≈5。这有一个直觉解释：K=3 majority vote\n    中 1 个被攻破的 judge 已经占 1/3 的权重，weakest link 影响巨大；K=9 中 1/9 权重，需要同时 攻破 5 个 judge 才能\n    flip panel，此时 diversity（不同 judge 的 failure mode 不同）确实提供了实质保护。 对 paper 的影响：weakest-link\n    theorem 需要 qualified as \"primarily applies to small panels (K≤5) and when panel\n    includes sufficiently weak members\"。 Practical recommendation 变为 regime-dependent\n    guidance：小 panel 重 robustness，大 panel 重 diversity。这对 framework paper narrative\n    实际上 是 positive——提供了一个清晰的、可操作的 regime boundary。\n","numLines":865,"startLine":1,"totalLines":865}}}
